# Cloudflare Pages. The first rule that matches wins, so the order is not free.

# One host, one address. The canonical link, the sitemap and hreflang all name
# the apex domain, so www must not answer with a copy of the site — two hosts
# serving the same pages is duplicate content.
https://www.tijanicsaviclegal.rs/*   https://tijanicsaviclegal.rs/:splat   301

# Serbian is the default locale and lives at the site root, with no prefix.
# /sr/ existed in an earlier version of the routing — keep the old links alive.
/sr               /                     301
/sr/*             /                     301

# The Studio resolves its own subroutes in the browser. Without this rule F5
# inside the Studio returns a 404, even though clicking through it works.
/studio/*         /studio/index.html    200
